  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">2025.12.6(토)</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">용인교육지원청 학부모 특강에 다녀왔습니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><b>1부 특강 :&#160;&#160;중학교 자유학기제</b></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">5분짜리 영상으로 제작하였습니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">(Notebook LM을 활용하였습니다~)</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><a href=\"https://youtu.be/vVcm3uIipxk?si=AVwt_I3o6CSxnOTD\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/vVcm3uIipxk?si=AVwt_I3o6CSxnOTD</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vVcm3uIipxk\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"600\" data-video-height=\"450\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bRpYhk/hyZPJw0xKY/idC9MYoazPOgYDDT8MCa51/img.jpg?width=480&amp;height=360&amp;face=0_0_480_360,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/vVwA2/hyZQD3IxZM/H7LXHMnV6h86cexBq7zYP1/img.jpg?width=480&amp;height=360&amp;face=0_0_480_360,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/b8vgc3/hyZQFtGMp7/rl2OiUwTURtRtPfJFcHmC1/img.jpg?width=480&amp;height=360&amp;face=0_0_480_360\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"480\" data-video-origin-height=\"360\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/vVcm3uIipxk\" width=\"600\" height=\"450\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><b>2부 특강&#160; : &#160;슬기로운 중학교 생활을 위한 학부모의 역할</b></p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160; (관리자에서 응원단장으로!)</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">7분짜리 영상으로 제작하였습니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">(Notebook LM과 Vrew를 활용하였습니다~)</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><a href=\"https://youtu.be/0WCLi-OvVDA?si=Kr-Xon-IRu8ClIlc\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/0WCLi-OvVDA?si=Kr-Xon-IRu8ClIlc</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0WCLi-OvVDA\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"600\" data-video-height=\"450\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bKNVHT/hyZPXJtRFB/fxvLnsbeR9qRldXbf50LIK/img.jpg?width=480&amp;height=360&amp;face=0_0_480_360,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bDU72l/hyZQrCcI4N/l3mIyAzP90l5ZjzdfYhGHk/img.jpg?width=480&amp;height=360&amp;face=0_0_480_360,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/8xJp1/hyZPZtMWk5/ikkpmFikAg3KJOoBPPVLI0/img.jpg?width=480&amp;height=360&amp;face=0_0_480_360\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"480\" data-video-origin-height=\"360\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/0WCLi-OvVDA\" width=\"600\" height=\"450\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>&#160;</p><p>경기도교육청에서 개발한</p><p>중학생 학부모를 위한 자료입니다.</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a6751278a9ef9e1dab05f5cd02a1d2f4577cb551?download\" data-file-name=\"2026 부모, 학부모가 되다(중학교).pdf\" data-file-size=\"8966272\" data-mimetype=\"application/pdf\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DAM6%26dataid%3D352%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20251224163649&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fa6751278a9ef9e1dab05f5cd02a1d2f4577cb551')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">2026 부모, 학부모가 되다(중학교)</span><span class=\"type\">.pdf</span></div><div class=\"size\">8.55MB</div></div></a></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
